ather than DailyMed.","requires_user_approval":false,"source_urls":["https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2020/009170Orig1s040lbl.pdf"]}],"summary":"Core FDA-label facts for primidone/Mysoline are largely verified, including indications, tablet formulation, dosing, maximum dose, adverse reaction list, and no FDA boxed warning. Updates are needed because the black-box source currently relies on DailyMed, the row misses trusted NCBI-supported half-life/metabolism/enzyme-induction facts, and alias fields are incomplete. No qualifying phase II/III placebo-controlled primidone epilepsy RCT was identified or cited, so the RCT/outcome N/A fields are appropriate."}
